-- הסכם קיבוצי ליישום רפורמת "אופק חדש" במערכת החינוך (25.12.2008) — the
-- vocabulary its sections share. Only what more than one section uses lives
-- here; a section's own terms live in its own file, beside the clause that
-- coins them.

IMPORT prelude

§ `הסכם אופק חדש — אוצר מילים משותף`

@desc The parties the agreement gives rights to or puts duties on.
DECLARE Party IS ONE OF
    `the teaching employee`
    `the State`
    `the teachers' union`
    `the Ministry of Education`
    `the wages commissioner at the Treasury`
    `the school principal`
    `the district manager`
    `the teaching personnel division`
    `the steering committee`
    `the supreme follow-up committee`

@desc The stage of education a teacher teaches in, as the agreement divides the work week by it.
DECLARE `school stage` IS ONE OF
    `a primary school`
    `a junior high school`
    `the grades from the tenth up`

@desc A teacher's weekly hours in the school, as part ו divides them.
DECLARE `work week` HAS
    `frontal hours`    IS A NUMBER @desc teaching in front of a class
    `individual hours` IS A NUMBER @desc with a small group or one pupil
    `stay hours`       IS A NUMBER @desc שעות שהייה: in the school, on the work the section lists

GIVEN w IS A `work week`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours of the week` w IS
    w's `frontal hours` PLUS w's `individual hours` PLUS w's `stay hours`

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER, i IS A NUMBER, s IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `a week of` f i s IS
    `work week` WITH
        `frontal hours`    IS f
        `individual hours` IS i
        `stay hours`       IS s
